DTSTAMP:20261101T180000Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Chicago:20261102T060000
DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20261102T061500
RRULE:FREQ=DAILY
SUMMARY:Become Her: morning questions, affirmations (1 of 3) and gratitude
DESCRIPTION:Open your dashboard: https://claude.ai/artifact/6XshoMapaC2Uy6ydpeEWnB\n\n1. Answer the four questions: Who do I want to be today? How do I want to feel today? What do I want to give today? What do I want to receive today?\n2. Say this week's affirmations out loud, then tap I said them to log the time.\n3. Log your morning gratitude.
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Become Her: morning questions, affirmations (1 of 3) and gratitude
TRIGGER:PT0M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
